Derived from github.com/nektos/act/pkg/exprparser v0.2.89.
Source: https://github.com/nektos/act/tree/v0.2.89/pkg/exprparser
Local changes: bounded numeric coercion, null comparison, nil map values and format bounds.
The public adapter supplies status semantics and rejects implicit filesystem access.
Forgelet uses map contexts instead of act's runner models, removes filesystem
hashing and runner status evaluation, and supports integral JSON array indexes.
No act runner, Docker client, Git client or resident Node runtime is linked.
The internal API omits act Config/default-status modes; the adapter owns them.
